|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| Payment Gateway | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Live Bracket View | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Double Elimination | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Clan / Orgs | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Achievements | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ⚠️ |
| Stream Integration | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Dispute Resolution | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ⚠️ |
| Mobile PWA | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Check-In System | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| KYC Verification | ⚠️ | ✅ | ❌ | ⚠️ |
| Push Notifications | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Analytics Dashboard | ⚠️ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

**Legend**: ✅ Fully implemented | ⚠️ Schema/logic exists, UI missing | ❌ Not implemented

---

## Recommended Build Order

**Month 1 (Foundation)**
1. Real Payment Gateway (Razorpay/Stripe)
2. Live Public Bracket Page
3. Check-In System UI

**Month 2 (Engagement)**
4. Clans UI
5. Achievement Unlock Logic + Profile Badges
6. Stream Integration (Watch Live button)
7. Dispute Resolution UI

**Month 3 (Trust & Scale)**
8. KYC Upload Flow
9. Push Notifications (FCM)
10. Mobile PWA Optimization
11. Host Earnings Dashboard

**Month 4 (Domination)**
12. Double Elimination Bracket Format
13. Match MVP + Spectator Code Display
14. Anti-Smurf Detection
15. Platform Analytics Dashboard
